一、哪些用 CC BY 4.0 · What is CC BY 4.0
---------------------------------------

给学习者读的文字，以及调研和文档：

1. 课程讲解与小测：app/src/content/lessons/*.tsx 里的文字，包括步骤标题和
   正文、提示、注释、「先猜再看」的问题与解释、小测的题目、选项和解释、本课
   要点；以及 app/src/content/lessons/index.ts 里每节课的标题和简介。
2. 术语表和概念卡：app/src/content/terms.ts；工具图鉴里每个命令的说明文字：
   app/src/content/ops.ts。
3. 课程大纲：app/src/content/curriculum.json。
4. 练习里的解释文字：app/src/content/practice.ts。
5. 案例拆解的讲解文字：models/ 里模型定义的 title、subtitle、teaches、
   why、pitfall、failures、notes 等文字字段，以及烘焙后 app/public/models/
   下各 manifest.json 里的同一份文字。
6. docs/ 下的全部文档，包括 docs/research/ 的调研报告和原始笔记。

Text written for learners, plus the research and documentation:

1. Lesson text and quizzes in app/src/content/lessons/*.tsx (step titles and
   bodies, hints, notes, predict-then-reveal questions, quiz questions, options
   and explanations, takeaways) and the lesson titles and summaries in
   app/src/content/lessons/index.ts.
2. Glossary and concept cards (app/src/content/terms.ts) and the command
   descriptions in the tool atlas (app/src/content/ops.ts).
3. The curriculum (app/src/content/curriculum.json).
4. Explanations in the practice exercises (app/src/content/practice.ts).
5. Teardown explanations: the text fields of the model definitions in models/
   (title, subtitle, teaches, why, pitfall, failures, notes, …) and the same
   text in the baked app/public/models/**/manifest.json.
6. Everything under docs/, including the research in docs/research/.


二、哪些用 MIT · What is MIT
---------------------------

能执行的部分都用 MIT（见 LICENSE）：网站代码（app/，包括课程文件里的组件、
场景控制器和判定逻辑）、模型代码和烘焙器（models/）、内核实测代码（spikes/），
以及烘焙出的几何文件（app/public/models/**/*.glb）。

一个文件里两种都有时（例如课程的 .tsx），代码按 MIT，给学习者读的中文文字
按 CC BY 4.0。

Everything that runs is MIT (see LICENSE): the website code (app/, including
the components, scene controllers and checks inside lesson files), the model
code and baker (models/), the kernel spike (spikes/), and the baked geometry
(app/public/models/**/*.glb). Where a file holds both (such as a lesson .tsx),
the code is MIT and the prose written for learners is CC BY 4.0.


三、怎么署名 · How to attribute
-----------------------------

转载、改编课程文字时，写明出处、许可协议，并说明是否做了修改，例如：

  内容来自 FeatureTree（linjiejim），https://featuretree.linjiejim.com ，
  按 CC BY 4.0 许可使用，有删改。

When you reuse or adapt the text, credit the source, name the licence and
say whether you changed it, e.g.:

  From FeatureTree by linjiejim, https://featuretree.linjiejim.com,
  licensed under CC BY 4.0; adapted.


